## 🎯 Success Criteria

An implementation is considered successful if:

1. All UI text is in Japanese
2. No TypeScript strict mode errors
3. All OpenSpec requirements are satisfied
4. Data persists via LocalStorage
5. Ant Design components are properly used
6. Manual browser testing passes

